@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #fafafa
skinparam node {
  BorderColor #1565c0
  BackgroundColor #e3f2fd
}
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #1565c0
  BackgroundColor #e8f5e9
}

title Escenarios Multitúnel, ConfigGen y NAT Detection\n5 tests · simultaneidad + persistencia + configuración + detección

node "orq (HUB)" as ORQ
node "pa" as PA
node "pb" as PB

package "TestMultitunelYEstado (2 tests)" as MULTI {
  rectangle "test_dos_tuneles_simultaneos" as T_MULTI
  rectangle "test_estado_wg_show" as T_WGSHOW
  T_MULTI -down- T_WGSHOW
}
package "TestConfigGenConLlavesReales (1 test)" as CG {
  rectangle "test_config_gen_produce\n_formato_valido" as T_CG
}
package "TestNATTypeDetection (1 test)" as NAT {
  rectangle "test_detectar_nat_type\n_en_vm" as T_NAT
}

== test_dos_tuneles_simultaneos ==
note over T_MULTI : Configura 2 túneles simultáneos:\n1) pa ↔ orq (hub)\n2) pb ↔ orq (hub)\n\nPing: pa → pb vía hub\nPing: pa → hub\nAmbos exitosos
PA -down--> ORQ : ping 10.99.0.3 (pb via hub)
PA -down--> ORQ : ping 10.99.0.1 (hub directo)

== test_estado_wg_show ==
note over T_WGSHOW : Configura túnel directo pa ↔ pb\nwg show → 1 peer (pb_pub)\nwg latest-handshakes → pb_pub > 0\nwg endpoints → pb_pub → 10.0.0.30:51820

== test_config_gen_produce_formato_valido ==
note over T_CG : Crea key temporal, env vars\nImporta config_gen vía importlib\nGenera [Interface] + [Peer] para\nhub-mesh con peers directos\nCopia .conf a pa via SCP\nwg-quick up → ok\nwg show → peer visible

component "config_gen.py" as CGGEN
component "wg0.conf temporal" as WGCONF
note right of WGCONF : [Interface]\nAddress=10.99.0.2/24\nPrivateKey=...\nListenPort=51820\n\n[Peer]\nPublicKey=hub_pub\nEndpoint=10.0.0.30:51820\nAllowedIPs=10.99.0.0/24
CGGEN -right-> WGCONF : genera
PA --up--> WGCONF : copia vía SCP

== test_detectar_nat_type_en_vm ==
note over T_NAT : Simula detect_nat_type()\ncon datos desde pa (PUBLIC_IP=10.0.0.20)\nNAT type esperado: "none"\n(red interna br1 sin NAT)

component "nat.py" as NATPY
NATPY -down-> PA : llama detect_nat_type()
PA --> NATPY : "none"

@enduml
